{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"おはよーうございます！ななみです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は横浜パシフィコで\n個別握手会ですよ〜o(^o^)o"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださる方々、\n待ってます！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日来れない方は\n次待ってます＼(^o^)／♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は髪型少し変えるんだ〜\nま、前髪だけだけど！\nハワイの子みたいになる予定！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回好評だったから\nお花のヘアピンもしよーっと！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近、中村航さんの\n僕の好きな人がよく眠れますように\nを読了しました((o(^-^)o))"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからは三浦しをんさんの\n天国旅行を読むよー＼(^o^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハッ そういえば\n私だいぶ日焼けしました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年は人生で一番海に通ってるよ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日はSUMMER NUDE６話放送です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"無事仲直りを果たした\n春夫さんと清子さん。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回は衝撃のラストだったので\n６話とっても楽しみ(@^O^@)\n早くみたいな〜♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、いま握手会第１部終了しました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は清子さんと春夫さんごっこが多い！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"只今第２レーンでは\n橋本奈々未と石狩清子と由本久美\n３人の中から１人選べます(゜-゜)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では、今日も引き続きがんばりまっしょい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、今日乃木どこ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな浴衣きてるよ！みてね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/nanami.hashimoto/img/0000-138.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では、２部行ってきます〜＼(^o^)／"}],"source":"archive"}